{"k":"p","w":84,"r":[{"t":"•Assuming the Rognarr Planet is at least Earth-sized (which is fair to say the least, as the gravity on their planet is far stronger than on Earth):"}]},
{"k":"img","w":111,"i":"i3","wh":[602,349]},
{"k":"p","w":111,"r":[{"t":"•The distance between Planet & Solar disk is 15968.5781455km."}]},
{"k":"gap","w":120},
