{"k":"img","w":123,"i":"i4","wh":[602,51]},
{"k":"gap","w":123},
{"k":"p","w":123,"r":[{"t":"•R is the radius of the Sun/Star, r is the radius of the Planet, and d is the Planet to Sun distance. We need to find z (the size/radius of the object which will block all the light) and y the distance that object is from the Planet (which we have already). In order to do this, we also need to determine x which is the distance at which the umbra becomes a point. We can take advantage of the properties of similar triangles to write:","i":1}]},
{"k":"gap","w":209},
{"k":"p","w":209,"r":[{"t":"R/(d+x) = r/x."}]},
{"k":"p","w":212,"r":[{"t":"Therefore:"}]},
{"k":"p","w":213,"r":[{"t":"x = rd/(R - r)."}]},
{"k":"p","w":218,"r":[{"t":"•Substituting in the radius of the Sun, the Planet to Sun distance at perihelion and the radius of the Planet (using Earth), we get:"}]},
{"k":"p","w":242,"r":[{"t":"x = 6371×149600000/(696340-6371)."}]},
{"k":"p","w":245,"r":[{"t":"x = 1381368.72816km."}]},
{"k":"p","w":248,"r":[{"t":"•In order to obstruct all sunlight from the planet, the object needs to have a radius of:"}]},
{"k":"p","w":265,"r":[{"t":"z = (6371(y+1381368.72816))/1381368.72816 = (6371(15968.5781455+1381368.72816))/1381368.72816."}]},
{"k":"p","w":270,"r":[{"t":"z = 6444.64855544km (radius of the Solar Disk)."}]},
{"k":"p","w":278,"r":[{"t":"Volume of sphere = 4/3πr³ = 4/3×π×6444.64855544³ = 1.12e+12km³ (volume of the Solar Disk)."}]},
{"k":"p","w":292,"r":[{"t":"Solar panels are almost entirely made of Silicon, so we will use that."}]},
{"k":"p","w":305,"r":[{"t":"Density of Silicon = "},{"t":"2330000000000 kg/km³","u":1,"a":"https://www.britannica.com/science/silicon"},{"t":"."}]},
{"k":"p","w":311,"r":[{"t":"Mass: "},{"t":"ρV = 2330000000000×1.12e+12 = 2.6096e+24kg.","i":1}]},
{"k":"p","w":317,"r":[{"t":"GBE formula [GBE applies to any object, aritifical or not, with a massive size] — "},{"t":"3GM²/5r:","i":1}]},
{"k":"p","w":334,"r":[{"t":"= 3×6.6742867e-11×2.6096e+24²/(5×6444648.55544) = ","i":1},{"t":"4.2316014e+31J//","i":1,"u":1},{"t":"10.114 Zettatons of TNT.","b":1,"i":1,"u":1}]},
{"k":"gap","w":340},
